    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_8",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "``I'm Gonna Love You Through It ''is a song written by Ben Hayslip, Sonya Isaacs and Jimmy Yeary and recorded by American country music artist Martina McBride. It was released in July 2011 as the second single from her album Eleven. On November 30, 2011, the song received a nomination at the 54th Grammy Awards for Best Country Solo Performance.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
